ucky? Break the door to turn back to the previous floor anytime. Farm lower levels and be prepared to face stronger opponents.</strong><br><br><strong>Unleash Your True Power</strong><br>Unleash Smyrna\u2019s true potential by activating \u2018Berserk\u2019 mode which allows you to attack at maximum speed for the duration.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826090/extras/86d9836a0b1a68c02230f145eba68327.poster.avif?t=1747235694\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826090/extras/86d9836a0b1a68c02230f145eba68327.webm?t=1747235694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826090/extras/86d9836a0b1a68c02230f145eba68327.mp4?t=1747235694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Challange Bosses</strong><br> You can challange boss of the current level by paying Crystals to the Mushroom King for extra materials.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826090/extras/a423802584933a193868c8512f819068.poster.avif?t=1747235694\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826090/extras/a423802584933a193868c8512f819068.webm?t=1747235694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826090/extras/a423802584933a193868c8512f819068.mp4?t=1747235694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Defeat three bosses and make your escape from the sunless dungeon Kalyzmyr.</strong>","developers":["PsychoSeel"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id"